@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
hide footbox
actor "HR / Admin" as P0
participant "HRView" as P1
participant "Otorisasi Google" as P2
participant "Google Calendar" as P3
P0 -> P1: Pilih pegawai dan jadwal
P1 -> P2: getAccessToken()
P2 -> P2: Periksa token / otorisasi ulang
P2 --> P1: Access token atau batal
P1 -> P3: POST calendars/primary/events
P3 --> P1: 201 / respons gagal
P1 --> P0: Konfirmasi hanya jika sukses
@enduml